    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know. the \"new chapter\" thing sounds nice but it doesn't feel real. it's not like i'm starting over, it's like the book just ended mid-sentence and now i'm just staring at the blank pages. there's no more \"me\" in this version. it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. it's just exhausting to keep pretending there's something left to build.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
